Second Homes Act (SHA)
SR 702 — Federal Act of 20 March 2015 on Second Homes (Second Homes Act, SHA).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2015/886]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
English consolidation of 1 October 2024, which is also the date of the current binding text.

:INFO
Preamble
The Federal Assembly of the Swiss Confederation,
on the basis of Articles 75 and 75b of the Federal Constitution, and having considered the Federal Council Dispatch dated 19 February 2014,
decrees:
|

:NOTE
SR 101
BBl 2014 2287

