Contents
1. General Provisions — 3 articles
2. Inventory of Homes and Proportion of Second Homes — 2 articles
3. Ban on the Construction of New Second Homes — 1 article
4. Construction of New Homes in Communes with a Proportion of Second Homes in excess of 20 per cent — 3 articles
5. Alteration of Homes in Communes with Proportion of Second Homes in excess of 20 per cent — 5 articles
6. Implementation — 6 articles
7. Criminal Provisions — 2 articles
8. Final Provisions — 6 articles

